@z_org_event
title: Organizational Work
new-page: true

Party organizers report on membership drives, local associations, and the Catholic press network.

The Center faction benefits most from organizational stability. Dissent across factions eases slightly.

- @z_party_hub: Return to Party Affairs

@z_electoral_strategy
title: Electoral Strategy
subtitle: Plan for upcoming elections and adjust party positioning.
view-if: time > 6
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources <= 0: Not enough resources. ?][? if time <= 6: Too early for election planning. ?][? if z_in_government != 1 and out_of_government_malus > 10: <span style="color:#8B0000;">High malus impairs electoral planning</span> ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.z_in_government != 1 && Q.out_of_government_malus > 0) {
